# Genially

> Genially is an online platform to create interactive and animated content without coding: presentations, infographics, gamified activities, e-learning courses and more. Used by 46M+ people in 190+ countries, including 11M+ teachers, with 130M+ creations and 18M+ teams in education and business.

Genially works in the browser. Every element can have interactions, animations and hidden content. Creations can be shared by link, embedded in websites and LMSs (Moodle, Canvas, Google Classroom, Microsoft Teams) or exported (PDF, JPG, MP4 video, QR, SCORM, xAPI). It includes AI tools to generate content and 1,300+ templates, 1,100+ of them free. The interface is available in English, Spanish, French, Italian, German and Portuguese (Brazil); creations can be written in any language.

## Plans

Genially has two families of plans: general plans, and education plans for teachers and schools. Each family ends with a custom-priced plan with its own page (Enterprise and Campus).

Prices are geolocated: the amount and currency shown on the plans pages depend on the visitor's region, so they can differ from country to country. Prices are per month, billed annually. For the exact price in a given region, always check the plans page itself.

### General plans

Overview, team pricing and comparison table: https://genially.com/plans/
- [Enterprise](https://genially.com/plans/enterprise/): custom pricing, the top plan. SSO, custom subdomain, activity tracking, groups and permissions, privacy and AI controls, and a dedicated Success Manager.

### Education plans

For teachers and schools; students join a teacher's workspace for free. Overview and comparison table: https://genially.com/plans/education/
- [Campus](https://genially.com/plans/campus/): custom pricing, the top plan, for schools, universities and institutions. SSO, custom subdomain, groups and permissions, the highest AI credit limit, onboarding and a dedicated Success Manager.
- [Plans for students](https://genially.com/plans/students/): student prices, from 1.25 € (StudentPro) in euros; other regions may see a different amount.

