## For developers

- [Genially Developer Center](https://developers.genially.com/): REST API for large organizations to build on Genially. Search and browse team content (spaces, folders and geniallys), read the detail of a genially, read tracking analytics of published geniallys (per-user sessions and question answers, or aggregated visits) and receive webhooks (slide views, interactive question answers, LTI sessions). Authentication with OAuth 2.1 or personal and team access tokens; the API is versioned (v1) and served over HTTPS. Access is limited to large clients.

## Security and privacy

- [Trust center](https://genially.com/trust-center/): SOC 2 Type 2 certified, GDPR compliant, aligned with FERPA and COPPA. Data stored in the European Economic Area (AWS, Ireland).
- [Genially and AI](https://genially.com/trust-center/ai/): how AI features handle your data.

